    "SABER platform registration since 2019. SABER is the UAE's online conformity assessment platform; importers upload the commercial invoice, packing list, bill of lading, COO, test report and the SABER conformity certificate for each shipment before the goods are loaded at the origin port. Without SABER clearance, the shipment can be delayed at port or rejected.": "SABER 平台自 2019 年起启用。SABER 是阿联酋的在线合格评定平台；进口商在货物在起运港装运前上传每批货物的商业发票、装箱单、提单、COO、测试报告和 SABER 合格证书。没有 SABER 清关，货物可能在港口延误或被拒收。",
    "For some categories, a Standards and Quality Control Organisation (SQCA) test certificate, but PTFE thread seal tape is generally not on the SQCA restricted list.": "对于某些类别，需要标准化与质量控制组织（SQCA）测试证书，但 PTFE 螺纹密封带通常不在 SQCA 限制清单内。",
