    "PTFE Thread Seal Tape Supplier in India | China PTFE Tape Factory { \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@graph\": [ { \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"https://www.qzjy.store/#organization\", \"name\": \"FuJianTeflonTape\", \"url\": \"https://www.qzjy.store/\", \"logo\": \"https://www.qzjy.store/assets/images/factory-clean.jpg\", \"description\": \"PTFE thread seal tape manufacturer in China for wholesale, import and OEM/ODM packaging orders\", \"address\": { \"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Quanzhou\", \"addressRegion\": \"Fujian\", \"addressCountry\": \"CN\" }, \"contactPoint\": [ { \"@type\": \"ContactPoint\", \"contactType\": \"sales\", \"email\": \"fujianteflontape1@gmail.com\", \"telephone\": \"+852-6895-4159\", \"availableLanguage\": [\"English\", \"Chinese\", \"Spanish\", \"Arabic\"] } ], \"sameAs\": [] }, { \"@type\": \"WebPage\", \"@id\": \"https://www.qzjy.store/markets/india.html#webpage\", \"url\": \"https://www.qzjy.store/markets/india.html\", \"name\": \"PTFE Thread Seal Tape Supplier in India | China PTFE Tape Factory\", \"description\": \"PTFE thread seal tape supplier for India wholesale plumbing, hardware, construction and OEM packaging markets. HS code 3920.99, BIS standards reference, import duty rates, required documents, port of entry and local market information for India.\", \"inLanguage\": \"en\", \"datePublished\": \"2026-06-05\", \"dateModified\": \"2026-06-05\", \"isPartOf\": {\"@id\": \"https://www.qzjy.store/#website\"}, \"about\": {\"@id\": \"https://www.qzjy.store/#organization\"}, \"primaryImageOfPage\": {\"@id\": \"https://www.qzjy.store/markets/india.html#primaryimage\"} }, { \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [ {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://www.qzjy.store/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Markets\", \"item\": \"https://www.qzjy.store/markets/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"India\", \"item\": \"https://www.qzjy.store/markets/india/\"} ] }, { \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [ { \"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What HS code is used for PTFE thread seal tape in India?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"PTFE thread seal tape is usually classified under Indian HS code 3920.99 (other plates, sheets, film, foil and strip of plastics) or 3920.10 (of polymers of ethylene) if the base is ethylene-based. India follows the Harmonised System with the Indian Trade Classification (ITC) code. Confirm the exact 8-digit ITC code with an Indian customs broker before shipping, as the classification can affect the basic customs duty (BCD), integrated GST (IGST) and any applicable social welfare surcharge.\" } }, { \"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is BIS certification required for PTFE thread seal tape?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"PTFE thread seal tape is generally not on the BIS mandatory certification list (ISI mark) for general plumbing use. However, if the tape is sold under a specific application standard (for example, certain industrial or potable water applications), the importer should confirm with a BIS consultant. For OEM private label or for tenders from government departments, the buyer may request a voluntary factory test report (density, thickness, tensile strength) and compliance statement. NSF/ANSI 61 or WRAS potable water certification is accepted by most institutional buyers.\" } }, { \"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Which Indian port is best for PTFE tape from China?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Nhava Sheva (Jawaharlal Nehru Port, Mumbai) handles 55% of India's containerised imports and is the most common gateway for West and South India, including Mumbai, Pune, Ahmedabad, Bangalore and Chennai. Mundra Port (Gujarat) is the largest private port and offers fast turnaround for North and West India. Chennai Port serves the Southeast corridor, including Chennai, Bangalore and Coimbatore. Kolkata Port serves the East. For nationwide distribution, a Nhava Sheva + Mundra combination is the most common routing strategy.\" } }, { \"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the standard payment term for Indian importers?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Most Indian importers pay 30% T/T advance with 70% balance against B/L copy, or 100% advance against scanned documents, for the first order. After 2-3 successful shipments, established Indian trading houses often move to L/C at sight (irrevocable, confirmed by an Indian bank) or open account 30-60 days. For orders above USD 50,000, a confirmed L/C is the safest option for both sides. UPI and small-value advance payments are also used for very small sample or trial orders.\" } }, { \"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can PTFE tape be sold in India without an Indian agent or distributor?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"For B2B wholesale, OEM and industrial supply, the importer (IEC holder) can import directly without a local agent. For retail consumer packs (hardware chains, e-commerce, modern trade), most foreign brands appoint an Indian distributor or appoint a sales agent. PTFE thread seal tape is not a restricted category, so foreign direct import is permitted under the existing foreign trade policy. The IEC (Import Export Code) is the only mandatory registration for direct import by an Indian entity.\" } } ] } ] } FuJianTeflonTapePTFE thread seal tape factory Home Products Blog Markets About Us Contact Us Get Quote PTFE Thread Seal Tape Supplier in India China factory supply of PTFE thread seal tape for India plumbing, hardware, construction and wholesale channels. Direct quotation, OEM private label, fast shipping to Nhava Sheva, Mundra, Chennai and other Indian ports. Get India Quotation WhatsApp India Suitable Channels in India India is one of the largest PTFE thread seal tape importers in South Asia. Demand is driven by a fast-growing construction sector, government-led housing programs (PMAY urban and rural), urban plumbing retrofits in Mumbai, Delhi, Bangalore, Chennai, Hyderabad, and ongoing pipeline infrastructure upgrades in industrial corridors. The most active wholesale and OEM channels include: Plumbing and sanitary ware wholesalers serving the residential and commercial new-build market": "印度 PTFE 螺纹密封带供应商 | 中国 PTFE 带工厂",
