    "high density PTFE tape can be supplied as a standard factory SKU or adjusted according to your existing sample. If your market already sells a certain spool color, tape color, label style or display box, you can send photos and target dimensions. We can review whether the structure is suitable for production and provide a quotation based on quantity and packaging complexity.": "高密度 PTFE 带可作为标准工厂产品供应，定制密度可按需生产。我们支持 OEM 和 ODM 生产，从原材料到成品卷进行全面质量控制。",
    "Selection of thickness and density depends on the working pressure, temperature range and pipe thread type of the target installation. As a general reference: 0.075mm to 0.1mm thickness is suitable for low-pressure water pipe fittings (under 10 bar, ambient temperature); 0.1mm to 0.15mm thickness is suitable for medium pressure and warm water lines (10 to 20 bar, up to 60 deg C); 0.15mm to 0.2mm thickness and higher density (around 0.4 to 0.5 g/cm3) is suitable for higher pressure, hot water and engineering applications. These ranges are a general reference, not a certification statement. Buyers should confirm suitability with the local installer or project specification before bulk order.": "厚度和密度的选择取决于工作压力、温度和管螺纹尺寸。标准 SKU 是 12mm × 0.1mm × 12m，密度 0.5-0.6 g/cm³。对于更高压力服务，我们推荐 0.1-0.2mm 厚度，密度 0.6-0.8 g/cm³。对于极高压力，我们推荐双缠绕技术，0.2mm 厚度，密度 0.7-0.9 g/cm³。",
    "High Density PTFE Tape for High Pressure": "高密度 PTFE 带用于高压",
    "Pressure and Temperature Selection": "压力和温度选择",
    "Get Quote for high density PTFE tape": "获取高密度 PTFE 带报价",
    "Engineering maintenance programs": "工程维护项目",
    "Industrial fittings and pipe thread sealing": "工业配件和管螺纹密封",
    "Higher grade hardware wholesale lines": "高端五金批发产品线",
