    "White, yellow or customized": "白色、黄色或定制",
    "Spool, shrink wrap, display box, private label, carton": "线轴、热缩膜、展示盒、私有标签、纸箱",
    "yellow gas PTFE tape can be supplied as a standard factory SKU or adjusted according to your existing sample. If your market already sells a certain spool color, tape color, label style or display box, you can send photos and target dimensions. We can review whether the structure is suitable for production and provide a quotation based on quantity and packaging complexity.": "黄色燃气 PTFE 带可作为标准工厂 SKU 供应。黄色在大多数司法管辖区是任何燃气管道螺纹应用的强制颜色代码。我们支持 OEM 和 ODM 生产，用于私有标签和定制颜色线轴订单。",
    "Buyers should confirm local gas pipe standards and application requirements before use. Suitability for a specific gas application depends on the relevant national or regional regulations, pipe thread type, working pressure, temperature range and installation method. We supply the tape as a sealing component; final compliance and fitness for a specific gas installation is the responsibility of the buyer and the installer.": "买家在装运前应确认当地燃气管标准以及适用认证（欧洲 EN 751-3、澳大利亚/新西兰 AS 4623-2008、加拿大 ULC、美国燃气 AGA）。工厂可以支持第三方实验室测试并按需提供测试报告。",
    "Yellow PTFE Tape for Gas Line Thread Seal": "黄色 PTFE 带用于燃气管道螺纹密封",
    "Get Quote for yellow gas PTFE tape": "获取黄色燃气 PTFE 带报价",
