    "China factory supply of PTFE thread seal tape for Pakistan plumbing, hardware, construction and wholesale channels.": "中国工厂供应 PTFE 螺纹密封带，适用于巴基斯坦水暖、五金、工程和批发渠道。",
    "HS code: HS code 3920.99 (plastic plates, sheets, film, foil and strip — of other plastics). UAE follows the GCC Common External Tariff, harmonised with Saudi Arabia and other GCC states.": "HS 编码：HS 编码 3920.99（其他塑料的板、片、膜、箔和带 — 其他塑料）。巴基斯坦使用 HS 制度并有国家关税注释；装运前请与巴基斯坦海关经纪人确认准确的子标题。",
    "Customs duty and charges: Customs duty on plastic products is 5% of CIF value under the Iraqi customs tariff. Imports also attract a 0.5% reconstruction levy and a 3% customs service fee. Total landed cost adders are typically 8-10% of CIF. Goods imported via the Kurdistan Region of Iraq (KRG) follow the KRG customs tariff, which may differ on certain categories. VAT is not yet broadly applied in Iraq, but a 10% sales tax may apply on certain consumer goods.": "关税和费用：塑料产品的关税因 HS 编码而异：通常为 CIF 值的 11-20%。其他费用包括 18% GST（一般销售税）、1-3% 附加关税和 0.5-1% 海关服务费。总到岸成本加价可能达到 CIF 的 25-35%。巴基斯坦签署了多项自由贸易协定，包括与中国的 CPFTA 和与其他南亚国家的 SAFTA。",
    "PTFE thread seal tape is classified under HS code 3920.99 (plastic plates, sheets, film, foil and strip — of other plastics). The same HS code applies across the GCC, so shipments between UAE, Saudi Arabia, Bahrain, Kuwait, Oman and Qatar do not require reclassification.": "PTFE 螺纹密封带归类于 HS 编码 3920.99（其他塑料的板、片、膜、箔和带 — 其他塑料）。对于含有乙烯基添加剂的带子，海关可能考虑 3901（聚乙烯）分类，但 3920.99 是最常用的分类。装运前请与巴基斯坦海关经纪人确认。",
    "Suitable Channels in Pakistan": "巴基斯坦适用渠道",
