    "HS code: HS code 3920.99 (plastic plates, sheets, film, foil and strip — of other plastics). UAE follows the GCC Common External Tariff, harmonised with Saudi Arabia and other GCC states.": "HS 编码：HS 编码 3920.99（其他塑料的板、片、膜、箔和带 — 其他塑料）。伊拉克使用 HS 制度并有国家关税注释；装运前请与伊拉克海关经纪人确认准确的子标题。",
    "PTFE thread seal tape is classified under HS code 3920.99 (plastic plates, sheets, film, foil and strip — of other plastics). The same HS code applies across the GCC, so shipments between UAE, Saudi Arabia, Bahrain, Kuwait, Oman and Qatar do not require reclassification.": "PTFE 螺纹密封带归类于 HS 编码 3920.99（其他塑料的板、片、膜、箔和带 — 其他塑料）。对于含有乙烯基添加剂的带子，海关可能考虑 3901（聚乙烯）分类，但 3920.99 是最常用的分类。装运前请与伊拉克海关经纪人确认。",
