    "Which Should You Buy?": "您应该购买哪种？",
    "For buyers who need a documented quality system, ask the factory for its test report covering density, thickness, tensile strength and elongation. Most reputable Chinese factories can issue a per-batch test certificate at no extra cost. For markets with mandatory third-party certification (SASO in Saudi Arabia, SABER in UAE, NSF/ANSI 61 in the United States for potable water), the importer is responsible for the registration and certificate, but the factory can provide supporting documentation.": "对于需要文档化质量体系的买家，请向工厂索取生产流程图、原材料证书和成品测试报告的副本。B2B 等级的 PTFE 带应在每批货物离开工厂前通过文档化的拉伸强度、密度、厚度和伸长率测试。工厂还应提供包装检验记录，确认订单规格、包装方式和标签设计与买家订单一致。",
    "Yes, PTFE tape and Teflon tape refer to the same product. Teflon is the brand name owned by Chemours (formerly DuPont) for PTFE. Generic PTFE tape has the same composition. The terms are used interchangeably in plumbing, hardware, and industrial supply. ASTM D3308 and ISO 9001 standards cover both branded and generic PTFE tape.": "是的，PTFE 带和 Teflon 带指同一种产品。Teflon 是由 Chemours（2015 年接管 DuPont 含氟聚合物业务的公司）注册的品牌名称。PTFE 是化学名称（聚四氟乙烯）。对于水暖应用，两者都指同一种材料 — 膨化 PTFE 螺纹密封带。唯一的区别是标签上的名称和价格（品牌 Teflon 带通常比无品牌 PTFE 带溢价 20-40%）。",
