    "For a plumbing distributor, 0.2mm tape is typically 5-10% of the volume, going to gas fitters, industrial maintenance teams, and OEM customers in food processing, chemical, and oil &amp; gas. For an OEM private label line, 0.2mm tape at 0.8-1.0 g/cm³ density is the right choice for any application where the joint has to hold gas or steam for the life of the equipment. Using 0.2mm tape on residential water is technically possible but is overkill and is not the right SKU mix.": "对于水暖分销商，0.2mm 带通常占销量的 5-10%，用于燃气装配工、工业维护团队以及食品加工、化工和石油天然气行业的 OEM 客户。对于 OEM 私人标签线，0.8-1.0 g/cm³ 密度的 0.2mm 带是任何需要在设备使用寿命内保持燃气或蒸汽的应用的正确选择。在住宅水上使用 0.2mm 带在技术上是可能的，但是是过度配置，不是正确的 SKU 组合。",
    "0.075mm vs 0.1mm vs 0.2mm thickness comparison: pressure rating, density, application envelope and SKU mix.": "0.075mm vs 0.1mm vs 0.2mm 厚度对比：压力等级、密度、应用范围和 SKU 组合。",
