    "Need factory quotation?Send size, quantity, packaging method and destination country. We can reply with MOQ, carton details and lead time.Get Quote": "需要工厂报价？发送尺寸、数量、包装方式和目的地国家或港口。我们将在 24 小时内回复价格、MOQ、交货时间和样品选项。",
    "Send application, temperature, pressure, density requirement, quantity, packing and destination port. White and high-density tape can be mixed in the same container.": "发送应用、温度、压力、密度要求、数量、包装方式和目的地港口。白色和高密度带可在同一集装箱中混合。",
    "Send application, thickness, density, width, length, quantity, packing and destination port. The three thickness tiers can be mixed in the same container.": "发送应用、厚度、密度、宽度、长度、数量、包装和目的地港口。三个厚度等级可在同一集装箱中混合。",
