    "Send color, width, length, thickness, density, quantity, packing and destination port. Yellow and white can be mixed in the same container.": "发送颜色、宽度、长度、厚度、密度、数量、包装和目的地港口。白色和黄色带可在同一集装箱中混合。",
    "Send the specification, quantity, packing method and destination port. We reply within 24 hours with price, MOQ, lead time and sample options.": "发送规格、数量、包装方式和目的地港口。黄色燃气带和高密度白色带可在同一集装箱中混合。",
