    "Ready to supply PTFE tape to the Indian market?": "准备向印度市场供应 PTFE 带？",
    "for a CIF Nhava Sheva or CIF Mundra quotation. We support 30/70 T/T, 20/80 for repeat customers, OEM private label, and IS 13083 third-party test reports on request.": "获取 CIF 那瓦舍瓦或 CIF 蒙德拉报价。我们支持 30/70 T/T，回头客 20/80，OEM 私人标签，并应要求提供 IS 13083 第三方测试报告。",
