    "for a CIF Nhava Sheva or CIF Mundra quotation. We support 30/70 T/T, 20/80 for repeat customers, OEM private label, and IS 13083 third-party test reports on request.": "Obtenga una cotización CIF Nhava Sheva o CIF Mundra. Soportamos 30/70 T/T, 20/80 para clientes recurrentes, marca privada OEM e informes de prueba IS 13083 de terceros bajo pedido.",
