  "This static form opens your email client with the inquiry details. You can later connect it to a third-party form service.": "该静态表单会打开你的邮件客户端并带入询盘内容。后续也可以接入第三方表单服务。",
  "Standard PTFE thread seal tape": "标准 PTFE 螺纹密封带",
