  "Private label orders can include logo printing, barcode, custom spool color, custom tape color, size, density, display box, blister card and carton design.": "自有品牌订单可包含 Logo 印刷、条码、定制轮芯颜色、带子颜色、尺寸、密度、展示盒、吸塑卡和纸箱设计。",
